  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:290px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-violet pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Ionic Capacitor</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Atlas.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20190401052027\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Atlas\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Atlas.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/279?cb=20190401052027\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Atlas.jpeg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/279?cb=20190401052027 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/3/35/Atlas.jpeg/revision/latest?cb=20190401052027 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Atlas\" width=\"270\" height=\"483\" data-image-key=\"Atlas.jpeg\" data-image-name=\"Atlas.jpeg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Atlas (Marvel Comics) can absorb and store ionic energy within himself.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Store ionic energy/forces.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb and store ionic energy/forces for later use</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Absorption\" title=\"Ionic Absorption\">Ionic Absorption</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Capacitor\" title=\"Capacitor\">Capacitor</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIonic_Capacitor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Ionic Storage/Containment</li>\n<li>Living Ionic Battery/Capacitance</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIonic_Capacitor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb ionic energy/forces and store it for later use. They are able to use the stored energy for any purpose they see fit, channeling it however they please.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FIonic_Capacitor%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Capacitor\" title=\"Cosmic Capacitor\">Cosmic Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Capacitor\" title=\"Electromagnetic Capacitor\">Electromagnetic Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electric_Capacitor\" title=\"Electric Capacitor\">Electric Capacitor</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Capacitor\" title=\"Heat Capacitor\">Heat Capacitor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ion_Attacks\" title=\"Ion Attacks\">Ion Attacks</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Infusion\" title=\"Ionic Infusion\">Ionic Infusion</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ion_Empowerment\" title=\"Ion Empowerment\">Ion Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Empowerment\" title=\"Cosmic Empowerment\">Cosmic Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetism_Empowerment\" title=\"Electromagnetism Empowerment\">Electromagnetism Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Electricity_Empowerment\" title=\"Electricity Empowerment\">Electricity Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Electromagnetic_Vision\" title=\"Electromagnetic Vision\">Electromagnetic Vision</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Heat_Empowerment\" title=\"Heat Empowerment\">Heat Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Empowerment\" title=\"Nuclear Empowerment\">Nuclear Empowerment</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiation_Empowerment\" title=\"Radiation Empowerment\">Radiation Empowerment</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Self-Sustenance\" title=\"Self-Sustenance\">Self-Sustenance</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Absorption\" title=\"Ionic Absorption\">Ionic Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ionic_Accumulation\" title=\"Ionic Accumulation\">Ionic Accumulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Nuclear_Capacitor\" title=\"Nuclear Capacitor\">Nuclear Capacitor</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Radiological_Capacitor\" title=\"Radiological Capacitor\">Radiological Capacitor</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Ionization\" title=\"Personal Ionization\">Personal Ionization</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Cosmic_Energy\" title=\"Personal Cosmic Energy\">Personal Cosmic Energy</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electromagnetism\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Personal Electromagnetism\">Personal Electromagnetism</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Electricity\" c